WEBVTT

00:11:58.059 --> 00:12:00.139
almost to the point of self-parody,

00:12:00.163 --> 00:12:05.641
is on it is a picture of the Civil War
battle flag of the Milwaukee regiment.

00:12:06.109 --> 00:12:08.415
SK: So that's the final element in it

00:12:08.439 --> 00:12:10.826
that just makes it
that much more ridiculous,

00:12:10.850 --> 00:12:15.525
that there is a flag design
within the Milwaukee flag.

00:12:15.549 --> 00:12:17.618
RM: On the flag. Yeah. Yeah.

00:12:17.642 --> 00:12:18.807
(Laughter)

00:12:18.831 --> 00:12:20.137
Yeah.

00:12:20.161 --> 00:12:21.869
(Music)

00:12:21.893 --> 00:12:24.284
Now, Milwaukee is a fantastic city.

00:12:24.308 --> 00:12:26.559
I've been there, I love it.

00:12:26.583 --> 00:12:28.859
The most depressing part
of this flag, though,

00:12:28.883 --> 00:12:31.980
is that there have been
two major redesign contests.